MemCut evaluation toolkit: third-party components

This toolkit does not vendor other projects' source. `tools/setup_upstreams.py` clones the memory systems under test
at fixed commits into `runtime/upstream/` on the user's machine; each keeps its own license:

- MemoryBank (SiliconFriend)  https://github.com/zhongwanjun/MemoryBank-SiliconFriend  (MIT)
- Nemori                      see configs/source_anchored_systems_v1.json for the pinned commit and repository
- LightMem                    see configs/lightmem_native_v1.json for the pinned commit and repository

Model weights and tokenizer files are downloaded by `tools/download_assets.py` from their publishers (Hugging Face,
OpenAI's public tiktoken files) under their own terms; none are included here. The MemCut data bundle in
../dataset/ is released under CC BY 4.0.
